+Their fix in every case is `Name a living requirement as
+<capability>/<requirement name in kebab-case>.` or `Name a living scenario as
+<capability>/<scenario name in kebab-case>.`
+
+This is a plan-level catch-22, not a code defect the task can fix within its
+scope: ADR 024 makes a tag to a not-yet-living requirement or scenario a
+broken reference, while this change adds the requirements and scenarios its
+own new code tags, and living specs change only when the change archives. One
+of these is needed:
